      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Antena. Como é pequeno e seu órgão elétrico ainda não está totalmente desenvolvido, Dedenne usa a cauda para absorver energia das casas. Eles emitem ondas elétricas pelos bigodes para se comunicar. Quando estão descarregados, enrolam-se e dormem.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Dedenne não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle, Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Charm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Parabolic Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Nuzzle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Volt Switch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Rest</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Snore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Charge Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Entrainment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Play Rough</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Discharge, Super Fang, Thunder</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Agility, Ally Switch, Attract, Charge, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Dig, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fling, Frustration, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Iron Tail, Last Resort, Light Screen, Magnet Rise, Misty Terrain, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Recycle, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Rising Voltage, Round, Seed Bomb, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, U-turn, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Covet, Eerie Impulse, Helping Hand, Magnet Rise, Natural Gift, Tearful Look</p>",
